              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ڈھابا (ḍhābā) is inherited: CDIAL lists Hindi ḍhābā, \"thatched roofing\", under ḍhapp, \"cover\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 5579); the sense \"a roadside eatery\", a place under a thatch, is probably a later one."
